The files in benchmarks_data/ are sampling manifests that hold only dataset
hashes, seeds and question identifiers. The files in tests/fixtures/ are authored
synthetic conversations shaped like those formats.

The optional `mem0` extra installs mem0ai (Apache License 2.0) for comparison
runs; it is not required by the core package.

